Well, mereology is strictly the logic of the part/whole relationship and tu=
rns out to be isomorphic to full-fledged plural quantification, so we get a=
ll that just by changing our spectacles.=C2=A0 (Indeed, set-theory and sing=
ular quantification raised as I was, I always thought of pq in mereological=
 terms, with L-sets -- except occasionally, when I wanted an empty set, in =
terms of C-sets.)=C2=A0 We can reconstruct the goo and slice notion of mass=
 but as derivative within the great semi-lattices the basic logic.=C2=A0 Wh=
en the cop drives his Hummer into the protesters, he gets protester all ove=
r his wheels and windscreen, just "lo protester" (with a fairly strange nod=
e as referent).=C2=A0=20
